        <div class="component-content active" id="mdp-content">
          <p>
            Regular activation addition
            <div class="formula-highlight" set:html={mathFormulas.activationAddition}></div>
            can be interpreted as a single-step Euler discretization of the ODE
            <div class="formula-highlight" set:html={mathFormulas.ode}></div>
          </p>
          <div class="conclusion-highlight">
            Thus, <strong>activation addition ≈ Euler discretization of activation dynamics</strong>.
          </div>
      </div>
