            For <span set:html={mathFormulas.inlineode}></span>, if
            <div class="formula-highlight" set:html={mathFormulas.barrierderive}></div>
            then <span set:html={mathFormulas.rawActivation}></span> stays in the region <span set:html={mathFormulas.goodRegion}></span>.
          </p>
          <div class="spacer" style="height: 0.5rem;"></div>
          <p>
            Based on <span set:html={mathFormulas.barriercdot}></span>, we unify two types of steering:
          </p>
